<details><summary>Solution</summary>This is a baby version of IMO 2018/2.

The given equation is  $a_i^2 + a_i = a_{i+1} a_{i+2} + a_{i+2}$ , so summing over all  $i$ , we obtain
\begin{align*}
&& \sum a_i^2 + \sum a_i & = \sum a_{i+1} a_{i+2} + \sum a_{i+2}
\implies && \sum a_i^2 & = \sum a_i a_{i+1}
\implies && \sum (a_i - a_{i+1})^2 & = 0
\end{align*}
and so  $a_i = a_{i+1}$  for all  $i$ .</details>

